 "description": "Get a brand's relationship: where to apply, each fact with its source quote, and whether Linty read the brand's terms. The facts include the form fields and the documents that the brand asks for. A fact has its quote in `source` only when LintyBot read it on the brand's page. Read `terms` before you apply: it says whether Linty read the agreement that the form asks you to accept. The default relationship is `wholesale`. The result is the JSON twin at `/brands/{slug}/{relationship}.json`.",
